# When the free daily limit of server calls is reached, /s/<name> (a skill page) is not served by its function and would answer 404.
# This rule shows the same page instead (it reads the name from the address and asks the database itself); only the link-preview tags are missing until the limit resets.
/s/*  /s  200
# a batch page (Amar Batch): the one page batch.html reads its batch from the address
/b/*  /batch  200
